WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.575
Close the back.

2
00:00:01.575 --> 00:00:04.645
Press until you hear two clicks, one at each end.

3
00:00:04.645 --> 00:00:07.190
Keep it shut until the film is out again.

4
00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:10.725
The frame wheel's teeth press on the film's top edge.

5
00:00:10.725 --> 00:00:13.950
If they are not in the film's holes yet, do not worry:

6
00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.495
the first turn of the winder drops them in.

7
00:00:16.495 --> 00:00:19.064
From now on, the film is in the dark.

